(1. MAIN PROJECT GOAL) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The project is about hidden identity recovery from morphed face images.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A morph image is created from two people:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  Person A + Person B -> morphed image M_AB) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(In our task, one identity is known:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  known identity = A) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The goal is to recover the other identity:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  hidden identity = B) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Simple example:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  input morph: Alice + Bob) Tj
T*
(  known identity: Alice) Tj
T*
(  target: recover Bob) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Presentation sentence:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Quote: Given a morph image and one known contributing identity, the goal is to) Tj
T*
(Quote: generate a face image that is closer to the hidden contributing identity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. DATASET: MAD22) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(MAD22 contains:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  1. Bona fide images: real/genuine source face images) Tj
T*
(  2. Morphed images: images created by combining two identities) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example morph filename:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  001_08-vs-010_08.jpg) Tj
ET
endstream
